1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:01,580
八千个红绿灯，
Eight thousand traffic lights.

2
00:00:01,580 --> 00:00:03,710
北京让它们全部联了网。
Beijing has networked all of them.

3
00:00:03,710 --> 00:00:05,640
现在AI开始管红绿灯，
Now AI is running the lights.

4
00:00:05,640 --> 00:00:07,680
有的路口车速提了两成。
Some junctions got about twenty percent faster.

5
00:00:07,680 --> 00:00:09,110
今天的烧脑问题：
Today's brain teaser:

6
00:00:09,110 --> 00:00:11,190
红绿灯怎么知道你要来？
how does a traffic light know you're coming?

7
00:00:11,190 --> 00:00:12,630
先说老式红绿灯：
First, the old lights:

8
00:00:12,630 --> 00:00:15,280
一天二十四小时，一个死节奏。
one fixed rhythm, twenty four hours a day.

9
00:00:15,280 --> 00:00:16,720
路上一辆车也好，
One car or

10
00:00:16,720 --> 00:00:19,350
一百辆车也好，红灯都那么长。
a hundred cars, the red lasts just as long.

11
00:00:19,350 --> 00:00:21,470
就像食堂只开一个窗口，
Like a canteen with one window open,

12
00:00:21,470 --> 00:00:23,320
队排多长都不加人。
no matter how long the line gets.

13
00:00:23,320 --> 00:00:25,400
于是有了你最熟悉的场景：
So you get the classic scene:

14
00:00:25,400 --> 00:00:28,280
空荡荡的路口，等一个超长的红灯。
an empty junction, and a really long red.

15
00:00:28,280 --> 00:00:29,680
秘密武器一：绿波。
Secret weapon one: the green wave.

16
00:00:29,680 --> 00:00:31,670
让一串红绿灯按顺序变绿。
A row of lights turns green one after another.

17
00:00:31,670 --> 00:00:33,350
就像体育场里的人浪，
Like a stadium wave,

18
00:00:33,350 --> 00:00:34,970
一个接一个站起来。
people standing up one after another.

19
00:00:34,970 --> 00:00:37,090
你踩着这道波浪的速度开，
Drive at the speed of the wave,

20
00:00:37,090 --> 00:00:38,610
就一路都是绿灯。
and every light is green.

21
00:00:38,610 --> 00:00:40,920
算笔账：两个路口相距五百米，
Do the math: two junctions five hundred meters apart,

22
00:00:40,920 --> 00:00:42,690
车速每小时五十公里。
cars at fifty kilometers an hour.

23
00:00:42,690 --> 00:00:45,480
五十公里每小时，大约每秒十四米，
Fifty an hour is about fourteen meters a second,

24
00:00:45,480 --> 00:00:47,350
五百米要开三十六秒。
so five hundred meters takes thirty six seconds.

25
00:00:47,350 --> 00:00:48,710
所以下一个路口，
So the next light

26
00:00:48,710 --> 00:00:51,040
要比上一个晚三十六秒变绿。
turns green thirty six seconds later.

27
00:00:51,040 --> 00:00:51,820
北京已经有
Beijing already has

28
00:00:51,820 --> 00:00:53,490
五百条这样的绿波路。
five hundred green wave roads.

29
00:00:53,490 --> 00:00:55,380
反转一：绿波怕堵车。
Twist one: green waves hate traffic jams.

30
00:00:55,380 --> 00:00:57,770
前面一排队，波浪就断了。
A queue ahead breaks the wave.

31
00:00:57,770 --> 00:00:59,520
堵车本身也是一种波，
A traffic jam is a wave too,

32
00:00:59,520 --> 00:01:01,040
而且是往后传的。
and it travels backward.

33
00:01:01,040 --> 00:01:02,360
前车一脚刹车，
One driver taps the brakes,

34
00:01:02,360 --> 00:01:04,190
后面一辆接一辆刹。
and the cars behind brake one by one.

35
00:01:04,190 --> 00:01:06,450
所以有时候前面根本没事故，
That's why sometimes there's no accident at all,

36
00:01:06,450 --> 00:01:08,300
你却莫名其妙地堵着。
and you're still stuck.

37
00:01:08,300 --> 00:01:10,780
秘密武器二：给路口装眼睛。
Secret weapon two: give the junction eyes.

38
00:01:10,780 --> 00:01:13,950
摄像头和雷达，数清每条车道的车。
Cameras and radar count every lane.

39
00:01:13,950 --> 00:01:16,180
系统把每辆车的轨迹拼起来，
The system stitches every car's path together,

40
00:01:16,180 --> 00:01:18,370
在电脑里造一个全息路口。
into a digital twin of the junction.

41
00:01:18,370 --> 00:01:19,900
然后大模型来排班：
Then a big AI model makes the schedule:

42
00:01:19,900 --> 00:01:22,410
五十秒内算出大约两百套方案。
about two hundred plans in fifty seconds.

43
00:01:22,410 --> 00:01:23,730
挑出最好的一套，
It picks the best one.

44
00:01:23,730 --> 00:01:26,320
堵的方向，绿灯多给一到十五秒。
The jammed direction gets one to fifteen extra seconds of green.

45
00:01:26,320 --> 00:01:27,870
反转二，最反直觉：
Twist two, the surprising one:

46
00:01:27,870 --> 00:01:29,530
绿灯不是越长越好。
longer green is not always better.

47
00:01:29,530 --> 00:01:30,990
你这边多绿一秒，
Every extra second of green for you

48
00:01:30,990 --> 00:01:32,930
横着那边就多红一秒。
is an extra second of red for the cross street.

49
00:01:32,930 --> 00:01:34,550
路口就像一块蛋糕，
A junction is like a cake.

50
00:01:34,550 --> 00:01:38,080
一分钟就这么大，切给谁都是从别人那抢。
A minute is a minute, and every slice comes from someone else.

51
00:01:38,080 --> 00:01:39,770
所以AI真正在做的，
So what the AI really does

52
00:01:39,770 --> 00:01:42,080
是让整片路网的总等待最少。
is shrink the total waiting across the whole network.

53
00:01:42,080 --> 00:01:44,430
结果：四道口一带十三个路口，
The result: thirteen junctions in one Beijing district,

54
00:01:44,430 --> 00:01:47,070
整体车速提了大约百分之二十一。
traffic about twenty one percent faster.

55
00:01:47,070 --> 00:01:47,740
拥堵指数
And the congestion index

56
00:01:47,740 --> 00:01:49,530
降了大约百分之十九。
fell about nineteen percent.

57
00:01:49,530 --> 00:01:51,430
反转三：将来的红绿灯，
Twist three: future traffic lights

58
00:01:51,430 --> 00:01:53,280
也许要和车直接说话。
may talk to cars directly.

59
00:01:53,280 --> 00:01:54,820
车说：我十秒后到。
The car says: I'll arrive in ten seconds.

60
00:01:54,820 --> 00:01:58,550
路口说：开每小时四十八公里，正好赶上绿灯。
The light says: drive forty eight, and you'll catch the green.

61
00:01:58,550 --> 00:02:00,130
到那时，自动驾驶的车
Then self driving cars

62
00:02:00,130 --> 00:02:01,990
就是踩着绿波的冲浪手。
become surfers riding the green wave.

63
00:02:01,990 --> 00:02:04,890
友情提示：这些是官方报道的试点数字，
Fine print: these are reported pilot numbers.

64
00:02:04,890 --> 00:02:07,430
别的城市、别的时段不一定一样。
Other cities and other hours may differ.

65
00:02:07,430 --> 00:02:08,790
而且再聪明的灯，
And no light, however smart,

66
00:02:08,790 --> 00:02:11,620
也救不了所有人同时出门的早高峰。
can save a rush hour when everyone leaves at once.

67
00:02:11,620 --> 00:02:13,540
红绿灯怎么知道你要来？
So how does the light know you're coming?

68
00:02:13,540 --> 00:02:16,270
它数车、算账，给你留一道波浪。
It counts, it calculates, and it saves you a wave.

69
00:02:16,270 --> 00:02:17,480
下次一路绿灯，
Next time you hit every green,

70
00:02:17,480 --> 00:02:18,980
别以为是运气好。
don't call it luck.

71
00:02:18,980 --> 00:02:19,930
那是一个AI
That's an AI

72
00:02:19,930 --> 00:02:21,700
在后面替你打节拍。
keeping the beat for you.

